04. A Co-ordinate Bench of this court, vide order dated 02.05.2025, while issuing notice, admitted the applicant to interim bail subject to furnishing the bail bond with one surety in amount of Rs.
50,000/- to the satisfaction of SHO, Police Station Janipur for the fulfilment of the following conditions:
(i) That the applicant shall not make any inducement, threat or undue influence to the person/s acquainted with the facts of the case so as to dissuade him/them from disclosing such facts to the Police or the Court;
(ii) That the applicant shall not repeat any kind of crime; and (iii) That the applicant shall cooperate with Investigating Officer as and when required;
05.
